      </div>
    </front>
    <body>
      <div xml:id="gom-act12">
        <head xml:id="gom-act12-Hd1e98">Caput 12</head>
        <div xml:id="gom-act12-Dd1e100">
          <head xml:id="gom-act12-Hd1e102">Versus 4</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-act12-d1e104">
            <quote xml:id="gom-act12-Qd1e106" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/act12_4@8-9">Quatuor quaternionibus.</quote>
            Quaternio <pb ed="#P" n="0454A"/> dicitur princeps quatuor militum. Sicut enim centurio centum, ita quaternio quatuor sub se milites habet.
          </p>
          <p xml:id="gom-act12-d1e112">
            <quote xml:id="gom-act12-Qd1e114" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/act12_4@13-13">Volens,</quote>
            etc.
            <ref xml:id="gom-act12-Rd1e117"><name xml:id="gom-act12-Nd1e118" ref="#RabanusMaurus">RAB.</name></ref>
            <quote xml:id="gom-act12-Qd1e121">Amplior enim gratia esset, si ipsi eum occiderent Judaei, quia princeps erat, non ipse Herodes, sicut et Jacobus.</quote>
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-act12-Dd1e125">
          <head xml:id="gom-act12-Hd1e127">Versus 6</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-act12-d1e129">
            <quote xml:id="gom-act12-Qd1e131" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/act12_6@15-16">Milites, vinctus,</quote>
            etc.
            <ref xml:id="gom-act12-Rd1e134"><name xml:id="gom-act12-Nd1e135" ref="#RabanusMaurus">RAB.</name></ref>
            <quote xml:id="gom-act12-Qd1e138">Quatuor difficultates cumulant custodiam: milites, catenae carcer, custodes.</quote>
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-act12-Dd1e142">
          <head xml:id="gom-act12-Hd1e144">Versus 7</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-act12-d1e146">
            <quote xml:id="gom-act12-Qd1e148" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/act12_7@7-7">Lumen.</quote>
            Signum praesentiae angeli Dei cujus praesentia soli Petro lumen praebebat, nec aliis refulgebat.
          </p>
          <p xml:id="gom-act12-d1e152">
            <quote xml:id="gom-act12-Qd1e154" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/act12_7@11-11">Percussoque.</quote>
            <ref xml:id="gom-act12-Rd1e157"><name xml:id="gom-act12-Nd1e158" ref="#RabanusMaurus">RAB.</name></ref>
            <quote xml:id="gom-act12-Qd1e161">Tactum corporalem, corpore ex aere sumpto, potuit habere angelus.</quote>
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-act12-Dd1e165">
          <head xml:id="gom-act12-Hd1e167">Versus 11</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-act12-d1e169">
            <quote xml:id="gom-act12-Qd1e171" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/act12_11@3-5">Ad se reversus.</quote>
            A culmine contemplationis ad hoc reversus est, quod in intellectu communi <pb ed="#P" n="0454B"/> prius fuit.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-act12-Dd1e179">
          <head xml:id="gom-act12-Hd1e181">Versus 13</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-act12-d1e183">
            <quote xml:id="gom-act12-Qd1e185" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/act12_13@6-7">Processit puella,</quote>
            etc. Et Dominum de tumulo egressum prima omnium mulier discipulis nuntiavit, ut ubi abundavit delictum, superabundaret et gratia.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-act12-Dd1e190">
          <head xml:id="gom-act12-Hd1e192">Versus 15</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-act12-d1e194">
            <quote xml:id="gom-act12-Qd1e196" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/act12_15@16-18">Angelus ejus est.</quote>
            <ref xml:id="gom-act12-Rd1e199"><name xml:id="gom-act12-Nd1e200" ref="#Jerome">HIER.</name></ref>
            <quote xml:id="gom-act12-Qd1e203">Magna dignitas animarum: ut unaquaeque ab ortu nativitatis habeat angelum in custodiam sui delegatum.</quote>
          </p>
          <p xml:id="gom-act12-d1e206">
            <ref xml:id="gom-act12-Rd1e208" type="lemma" subtype="implied" target="http://scta.info/resource/act12_15@16-18"/>
            <ref xml:id="gom-act12-Rd1e210"><name xml:id="gom-act12-Nd1e211" ref="#Jerome">ID.</name></ref>
            <quote xml:id="gom-act12-Qd1e214"><seg type="qs">Quod autem unusquisque nostrum habeat angelos</seg>, etc., usque ad <seg type="qs">isti sunt qui ascendunt et descendunt super Filium hominis.</seg></quote>
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-act12-Dd1e223">
          <head xml:id="gom-act12-Hd1e225">Versus 17</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-act12-d1e227">
            <quote xml:id="gom-act12-Qd1e229" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/act12_17@6-6">Tacerent,</quote>
            etc. Donec narraret virtutem: vel tacere jubet, ne clamore gaudentium adventus ejus in civitate cognoscatur.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-act12-Dd1e234">
          <head xml:id="gom-act12-Hd1e236">Versus 23</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-act12-d1e238">
            <quote xml:id="gom-act12-Qd1e240" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/act12_23@1-1">Confestim,</quote>
            etc. Dum impietatem illicitae <pb ed="#P" n="0454C"/> adulationis non exhorreret, respiciens paulo post imminentem et insistentem capiti suo vidit angelum, eumque sensit continuo exitii sui ministrum, quem prius noverat provisorem bonorum. Inde continuis septem diebus ventris dolore cruciatus, vitam violenter abrupit.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </body>
